# {{.ProjectName}}

Clean Architecture service (`{{.ModulePath}}`).

Run the tests:

    go test ./...

Copy the env file and start Postgres, then check the contract:

    cp .env.example .env
    docker compose up -d
    envcraft doctor

Start the server:

    go run ./cmd/server

The HTTP server stores users in memory. `DATABASE_URL` is the local Postgres service declared by `envcraft.yaml`.

Routes:

- `GET /health`
- `POST /users` with JSON fields `id`, `email`, and `name`
- `GET /users/{id}`
